# The container images CI runs, pinned by digest: the same binaries check
# this repository here and on a contributor's machine.
#
# They live here rather than in the workflows so fleet triage can move them
# when a tag is rebuilt or a line is superseded, with a token that cannot
# rewrite workflows. Only KEY=VALUE lines are read.
